OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStaying mostly dry, with spells
OL,6,Fof warm sunshine and light to moderate
OL,7,Feasterly winds. Low cloud over the
OL,8,Fhills to start but will lift into the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Best of the sunshine will
OL,10,Fbe by late afternoon. Feeling warm.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA clear and bright evening
OL,13,Ffor many. Cloud thickens and lowers
OL,14,Fover the hills in the east overnight,
OL,15,Fwith isolated light showers in the
OL,16,Fsouth later. Mild night to come.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
